- 2026-09-06 · **B2 — SUPERSEDES the step references in eight lines of the `### Architecture round — ARCH-S02` section above.** Those lines cite step ids that name a different step than the one the sentence means. **The eight lines stay exactly as written and are read together with this table**; every seat resolving a step id from that section uses the RIGHT-HAND column · The corrected mapping, measured by cross-referencing every `S02-Snn` token in this file against the `- **S02-Snn ·` step headers in `PLAN.md`:

